1
00:00:00,533 --> 00:00:02,453
(Wil:)...and she said she wasn't sure.

2
00:00:03,078 --> 00:00:06,578
(Wil:)And she strung me along
for almost two years. It was brutal.

3
00:00:07,123 --> 00:00:09,833
(Penny:)-Oh, I'm sorry.
-Thanks.

4
00:00:10,376 --> 00:00:12,756
(Wil:)I wish she had just broken up with me
right there.

5
00:00:13,421 --> 00:00:15,251
(Wil:)Put me out of my misery.

6
00:00:15,423 --> 00:00:17,553
(Raj:)-Really?
-Yeah. Would have been kinder.

7
00:00:18,009 --> 00:00:20,299
(Stuart:)-Wil, you're up.
-Oh, that's me.

8
00:00:25,767 --> 00:00:27,727
(Sheldon:)Did you let Wil Wheaton
get in your head?

9
00:00:27,936 --> 00:00:30,106
(Penny:)-What are you talking about?
-He's evil.

10
00:00:30,271 --> 00:00:32,231
(Sheldon:)He plays evil mind games.

11
00:00:32,398 --> 00:00:34,738
(Sheldon:)-Did he tell you his grandmother died?
-No.

12
00:00:34,943 --> 00:00:38,983
(Sheldon:)If he does, don't believe it. He's not above
playing the dead meemaw card.

13
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:43,780
(Wil:)Yes!

14
00:00:44,953 --> 00:00:47,123
Enjoy the accolades now,
Wil Wheaton.

15
00:00:47,288 --> 00:00:49,748
But like your time on
Star Trek: Next Generation...

16
00:00:49,916 --> 00:00:52,506
...your smug self-satisfaction
will be short-lived.

17
00:00:54,379 --> 00:00:56,549
(Leonard:)-Penny, you're up.
-All right, remember...

18
00:00:56,714 --> 00:01:00,304
(Sheldon:)-...his meemaw's alive and be the ball.
-Yeah. I got it.

